Package: ddns-scripts
Version: 2.1.0-5
Depends: libc
Source: feeds/packages/net/ddns-scripts
License: GPL-2.0
Section: net
Maintainer: Christian Schoenebeck <christian.schoenebeck@gmail.com>
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: 78989
Description:  A highly configurable set of scripts for doing dynamic dns updates.
 - IPv6 support
 - force communication to IPv4 or IPv6 only
 - DNS server support
 - using BIND host if installed
 - DNS requests via TCP
 - Proxy server support
 - log file support
 - support to run once
